cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with each dataset you use."
type: software
title: "bearing-datasets: public bearing fault datasets in one common format"
abstract: >-
  Python library and command-line tool that downloads 69 public bearing and
  rotating-machinery fault datasets (CWRU, Paderborn, XJTU-SY, FEMTO-ST PRONOSTIA,
  NASA IMS, MFPT and others) from their original sources, checks them against pinned
  sha256 checksums, and converts each one into the same format: one metadata table
  (one row per signal) plus the signals in Parquet. Covers fault diagnosis and
  prognostics (run-to-failure, remaining useful life) data. Code only: the datasets
  keep their own licenses.
authors:
